{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本首相高市早苗周四（15日）宣布，任命自民黨眾議員、前農林水產副大臣武部新，接替因發表濫權言論等醜聞而辭職的簗和生，出任農林水產相。</p><p>日本傳媒報道，高市最快周四晚舉行閣員認證儀式，希望盡快重整內閣體制。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:03:05.265719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:19:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:13.637947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:13.993944+00:00","content_hash":"91f1d16be7d799f562b8f9fdedebaa5ab03f49c0c988f12a9af79f47dfd5e494","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}